{"id":"n44138-1-8","stage":2,"title":"달빛 · 月色","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n44138-1-8-1","ko":"달빛이 참 환하네.","zh":"月光真明亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"달빛이","meaning":"月色，月光","explanation":"달빛：月色，月光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"달빛","audio":"/audio/b162f0baeac46602a8ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44138","senseId":"1","lemma":"달빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"환하네.","meaning":"明亮，亮，亮堂","explanation":"환하다：明亮，亮，亮堂；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"환하다","audio":"/audio/14112325e485b805f0e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87071","senseId":"1","lemma":"환하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b162f0baeac46602","term":"달빛","zh":"月色，月光","audio":"/audio/b162f0baeac46602a8ca.mp3","entryId":"44138","definition":"月亮反射的光芒。","pronunciation":["달삗"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"14112325e485b805","term":"환하다","zh":"明亮，亮，亮堂","audio":"/audio/14112325e485b805f0e1.mp3","entryId":"87071","definition":"光线照射清晰而亮。","pronunciation":["환ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/33d45cc2c244af221631.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n44138-1-8-2","ko":"응. 달이 어두운 거리를 밝게 비추고 있어.","zh":"嗯，月亮正把昏暗的街道照得亮亮的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달이","meaning":"月，月亮，月球","explanation":"달：月，月亮，月球；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"1","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어두운","meaning":"暗，黑暗","explanation":"어둡다：暗，黑暗；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어둡다","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89860","senseId":"1","lemma":"어둡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거리를","meaning":"大街，街头，马路","explanation":"거리：大街，街头，马路；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"거리","audio":"/audio/51e49276d394c94f94a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20187","senseId":"1","lemma":"거리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밝게","meaning":"亮","explanation":"밝다：亮；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"밝다","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62105","senseId":"1","lemma":"밝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비추고","meaning":"照","explanation":"비추다：照；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"비추다","audio":"/audio/b25ea88d85b093d759ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15994","senseId":"1","lemma":"비추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月，月亮，月球","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"晚上天空中出现的圆形明亮的发光天体。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"ced8d3736f75b7c3","term":"어둡다","zh":"暗，黑暗","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3","entryId":"89860","definition":"没有光或光线很弱而不亮。","pronunciation":["어둡따"]},{"id":"51e49276d394c94f","term":"거리","zh":"大街，街头，马路","audio":"/audio/51e49276d394c94f94a8.mp3","entryId":"20187","